    <briefdescription>
<para>configuration structure holding the passed homing paramters from the ros2_control urdf </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Saving all parameters on initialization in a structure allows for quick access during runtime. See <ref refid="classbioscara__hardware__drivers_1_1BaseJoint_1ae05e1fd900c1d905ebec9a00ea5b2628" kindref="member">bioscara_hardware_drivers::BaseJoint::_home()</ref> for the description of the homing procedure. </para>
